## Xcode
## The project is generated by XcodeGen from project.yml (see README), and
## never committed: a generated pbxproj can bake in locally selected
## signing settings, which must stay out of this public repo.
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/
DerivedData/
.build/
.swiftpm/

